    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Press D to die</h2>Die with just the simple press of a button! Unlike in real life, suicide will actually help you by leaving behind a corpse. A corpse can be interacted with using other abilities in various combinations in order to reach previously unreachable places.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve problems in your own way</h2>With a few exceptions, any challenge in which you can place corpses could be solved in a ways which we as developers didn't think to be possible.<br>This is because of the the abilities the Player Character has and especially how these interact with corpses<br>&quot;what are these abilities?&quot; (a question you definitely just asked yourself) - well, that's for us to know and for you to find out!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3 distinct Levels</h2>With a total first time playtime of about 45min to 1:30h (depending on familiarity with 2d platformers), each of the 3 levels has distinct themes of gameplay, visual aesthetic and original music.<br><br>We are aware of the games comparably short length, but we can confidently say: If you're looking for a short and unique platformer experience, Press D to Die is for you!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Press D to die</h2>Die with just the simple press of a button! Unlike in real life, suicide will actually help you by leaving behind a corpse. A corpse can be interacted with using other abilities in various combinations in order to reach previously unreachable places.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve problems in your own way</h2>With a few exceptions, any challenge in which you can place corpses could be solved in a ways which we as developers didn't think to be possible.<br>This is because of the the abilities the Player Character has and especially how these interact with corpses<br>&quot;what are these abilities?&quot; (a question you definitely just asked yourself) - well, that's for us to know and for you to find out!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3 distinct Levels</h2>With a total first time playtime of about 45min to 1:30h (depending on familiarity with 2d platformers), each of the 3 levels has distinct themes of gameplay, visual aesthetic and original music.<br><br>We are aware of the games comparably short length, but we can confidently say: If you're looking for a short and unique platformer experience, Press D to Die is for you!",
    "short_description": "The path to victory has to be paved with corpses, but who said they can't be your own? In this quick to finish puzzle-platformer, they can be!",
